[[2,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Temporarily refit the rigid power unit support.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/179002328.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,3,0,"<p>- Raise the vehicle.</p><p>1. Undo the fixing bolts (1a) and remove the flywheel guard (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/179002329.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,3,0,"<p>1. Fit the flywheel lock.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/179000407.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></th><th><p>Description</p></th><th><p>Code</p></th><th><p>Function</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Flywheel lock</p></td><td><p>1.867.030.000</p></td><td><p>Engine flywheel lock</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/179002331.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,3,0,"<p>1. Remove the anchoring pin from the toothed drive pulley.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/179000407.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></th><th><p>Description</p></th><th><p>Code</p></th><th><p>Function</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Pins</p></td><td><p>1.870.893.000</p></td><td><p>Securing crankshaft and timing pullies</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the fixing bolt (2a) and remove the timing belt toothed drive pulley (2b).</p><p>- Keep the key from the housing in the crankshaft.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/179002332.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</